/// NodeSupervisor — root supervisor of every cluster node.
///
/// Each node runs one locally supervised `Worker`. Workers the coordinator
/// spawns remotely are *not* children of this tree (no link, ADR 0126 §3).
Supervisor subclass: NodeSupervisor

  strategy -> #oneForOne | #oneForAll | #restForOne => #oneForOne

  childSpecs => #(Worker)
